config SAMPLE_DIAGNOSTIC_SCENARIO
    int "One-shot sample diagnostic scenario (0 disables injection)"
    range 0 8
    default 0
    help
        1 input pause; 2 executor pause; 3 execution status pause; 4 head IMU;
        5 vision; 6 referee permission; 7 measured power;
        8 incorrect interboard protocol identifier.
        A supported scenario runs once after 3 seconds of active operation.
        Pauses last 1.5 seconds. Operator stop cancels the exercise.
